# Canalave's Move Deleter (decomp ScrCmd_SelectPartyMonMove, GetSelectedPartyMonMove, ClearPartyMonMoveSlot): the
# summary picks a move with no new one (an HM too: Cut), it is forgotten and the moves after it move up.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIDOOF 20 platinum:MOVE_TACKLE platinum:MOVE_CUT platinum:MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_CANALAVE_CITY_EAST_HOUSE 3 6 left
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party
+1 tap slot:0
until app none
advance text
until app summary
# The first tap shows the move, the second picks it.
+2 tap move:1
+2 tap move:1
until app none
advance text
until yesno
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves ["platinum:MOVE_TACKLE","platinum:MOVE_ROCK_SMASH"]
+0 assert state party[0].pp [35,15]
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves ["platinum:MOVE_TACKLE","platinum:MOVE_ROCK_SMASH"]
